  <!-- ============================================
       01 — HERO
       ============================================ -->
  <%- include('partials/page-hero', {
    eyebrow: 'Why MedhaIQ',
    title: 'Why MedhaIQ Exists',
    sub: "Interview preparation shouldn't be a one-time event. It should be Continuous Career Intelligence."
  }) %>

  <!-- ============================================
       02 — THE PROBLEM: THE TRANSACTIONAL TRAP
       ============================================ -->
  <section class="mh-why-problem reveal">
    <div class="mh-why-narrow mh-section-center">
      <div class="mh-eyebrow">The Problem</div>
      <h2 class="mh-section-title">The Transactional Trap</h2>
      <p class="mh-why-body">
        Most interview preparation is optimized for a single event. Once the interview ends, the learning disappears with it.
      </p>
      <p class="mh-why-body">
        The next opportunity starts from zero — again.
      </p>
      <p class="mh-why-body mh-why-body-emphasis">
        That's the transactional trap.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================
       03 — THE PARADIGM SHIFT: FROM CRAMMING TO PROGRESSION
       ============================================ -->
  <section class="mh-why-shift reveal">
    <div class="mh-why-narrow mh-section-center">
      <div class="mh-eyebrow">The Paradigm Shift</div>
      <h2 class="mh-section-title">From Cramming to Progression</h2>
      <p class="mh-why-body">
        Traditional prep is episodic: one script, one outcome, then it's gone.
      </p>
      <p class="mh-why-body">
        MedhaIQ treats readiness as something built, not crammed — each session compounding into the next. Not a single verdict. A growth curve.
      </p>
      <p class="mh-why-body mh-why-body-emphasis">
        That's the shift: from a test survived once, to a skill that keeps compounding.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================
       04 — CORE PHILOSOPHY
       ============================================ -->
  <section class="mh-why-philosophy reveal">
    <div class="mh-why-narrow">
      <blockquote class="mh-why-quote">
        <span class="mh-why-quote-mark">&#8220;</span>
        Professionals don't need another answer generator. They need a better thinking system.
      </blockquote>

      <p class="mh-why-body">
        Most tools optimize for the next thirty minutes — a sharper line, a better script. MedhaIQ optimizes for the thinking underneath the answer: how someone reasons under pressure, structures a response, and communicates judgment. That's what carries from one room to the next.
      </p>
      <p class="mh-why-body">
        Our objective isn't helping someone pass one isolated interview; it's helping someone become the kind of professional who naturally succeeds in every interview.
      </p>
      <p class="mh-why-body">
        This philosophy is reflected throughout MedhaIQ—from adaptive interview simulations and structured STAR coaching to multi-vector performance analysis and longitudinal career tracking.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================
       05 — THE THREE PILLARS
       ============================================ -->
  <section class="mh-why-pillars reveal">
    <div class="mh-why-pillars-inner">
      <div class="mh-section-center">
        <div class="mh-eyebrow">How It's Built</div>
        <h2 class="mh-section-title">The Three Pillars</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="mh-why-pillar-grid">

        <div class="mh-why-pillar-card reveal-item">
          <div class="mh-why-pillar-icon">&#9889;</div>
          <h3 class="mh-why-pillar-title">Real-Time Stress Testing</h3>
          <p class="mh-why-pillar-desc">
            Pressure reveals what rehearsal hides. MedhaIQ recreates real evaluation conditions — live and adaptive — so growth happens under the same conditions it's tested in.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mh-why-pillar-card reveal-item">
          <div class="mh-why-pillar-icon">&#9737;</div>
          <h3 class="mh-why-pillar-title">5-Vector Intelligence</h3>
          <p class="mh-why-pillar-desc">
            Every response is scored across five dimensions — structure, domain depth, strategic thinking, communication, and leadership — turning one performance into a precise map of strengths and gaps.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mh-why-pillar-card reveal-item">
          <div class="mh-why-pillar-icon">&#8734;</div>
          <h3 class="mh-why-pillar-title">Living Profile of Mastery</h3>
          <p class="mh-why-pillar-desc">
            Progress isn't a single score. It's a living record of how someone thinks, communicates, and executes — evolving with every session.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
